  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved food security of rural poor in Minya - FAO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will contribute to reduced poverty, improved food security and nutrition and resilient livelihoods for vulnerable rural women, youth and disabled people and building back a more sustainable climate-resilient food system in Minya Governorate.</narrative>
  </description>
